CORE
combinational_cycle1.sv
--bound 1
^\[main\.p0\] always main\.a == main\.b: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.p1\] always main\.a == 0: REFUTED$
^\[main\.p2\] always main\.a == 1: REFUTED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Nets on a combinational cycle are unconstrained, apart from the cycle.
